{"4143610": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "REAL MOON", "steam_appid": 4143610, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&lt;A Realistic Lunar Surface Built from Observation Data&gt;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using a simulation environment developed through joint research between JAXA and historia Inc., this game recreates a scientifically grounded, realistic Moon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- High-resolution DEM data (terrain elevation)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Statistical crater distribution</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Natural rock dispersion patterns</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Sun, Earth, and Moon positions that change over time</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The lunar terrain featured in this game is a result of joint research with JAXA.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&lt;Explore the Lunar Surface&gt;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk across the precisely recreated Moon, pilot a rover, and explore freely at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Alone on the lunar surface, you receive a single mission.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4143610/extras/c9a455a18cd2cc3d727579a046d1984f.avif?t=1766736643\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4143610/extras_big/c9a455a18cd2cc3d727579a046d1984f.webp?t=1766736643 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>In addition to observation data, slopes of craters and other features are synthesized based on scientific studies and added to the terrain data.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playtime: 15–30 minutes</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&lt;A Realistic Lunar Surface Built from Observation Data&gt;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using a simulation environment developed through joint research between JAXA and historia Inc., this game recreates a scientifically grounded, realistic Moon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- High-resolution DEM data (terrain elevation)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Statistical crater distribution</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Natural rock dispersion patterns</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Sun, Earth, and Moon positions that change over time</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The lunar terrain featured in this game is a result of joint research with JAXA.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&lt;Explore the Lunar Surface&gt;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk across the precisely recreated Moon, pilot a rover, and explore freely at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Alone on the lunar surface, you receive a single mission.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4143610/extras/c9a455a18cd2cc3d727579a046d1984f.avif?t=1766736643\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4143610/extras_big/c9a455a18cd2cc3d727579a046d1984f.webp?t=1766736643 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>In addition to observation data, slopes of craters and other features are synthesized based on scientific studies and added to the terrain data.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playtime: 15–30 minutes</p>", "short_description": "Explore a precisely recreated lunar surface built from real data and a JAXA-backed simulation.", "supported_languages": "English, Japanese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4143610/380705e9ca12d3a6abfcacf8812247a0ff64cc85/header.jpg?t=1766736643", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4143610/5a965e4ba2b05dc17370f619083ac6973c50d1cd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766736643", "capsule_image